          "data": {
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "type": "object",
            "title": "Data",
            "readOnly": true
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "data"
        ],
        "title": "Plotly",
        "description": "Plotly visualization.\n\nThis visualization wraps a Plotly `Figure`. The figure is stored internally as a\nprivate attribute and is exposed through the `figure` property.\n\nThe JSON-serializable representation is provided by the computed `data` field,\nwhich serializes the figure to Plotly JSON.\n\nAttributes:\n    type: Fixed discriminator `\"plotly\"`.\n    figure: Wrapped Plotly figure (available as a property).\n\nNotes:\n    The figure is stored in a Pydantic private attribute (`_figure`).\n    The `data` field is computed from `figure` using Plotly JSON serialization."
      },
